message: If you use pwsh-termux, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: pwsh-termux
abstract: An unofficial, signed apt repository that packages Microsoft's PowerShell 7 (stable and preview) for Termux on arm64 Android, verified against Microsoft's hashes, patched for Termux's glibc and updated automatically.
authors:
